.TH std::mdspan::rank_dynamic 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::mdspan::rank_dynamic \- std::mdspan::rank_dynamic

.SH Synopsis
static constexpr rank_type rank_dynamic() noexcept;  (since C++23)

Returns the number of dynamic dimensions in a mdspan. Equivalent to return
Extents::rank_dynamic().

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

The number of dynamic dimensions.

